WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.600
A white and violet alien clerk gives a terrifyingly smug look.

2
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:01.400
He proudly presents a white chest freezer in the frozen-food aisle.

3
00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:02.800
The alien awkwardly climbs into his own appliance.

4
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:03.650
Cold mist and ice shards burst around the freezer, forming a protective frost barrier.

5
00:00:03.650 --> 00:00:04.350
He shivers inside the chest freezer while trying to retain a commanding expression.

6
00:00:04.350 --> 00:00:05.700
The lid closes. He peeks out once, then hides from the rest of the incident.
